""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "", "audiosrc": "a", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Isn't this a great place?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Yes, and it's classy. In fact, I've never heard of it.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: It's not new. Actually, I come here quite often. I was going to bring you here but never had a chance to.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: There were so many things we were supposed to do together. In fact, going for a drink was one of them.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I know, but you don't like to mix business with pleasure so ...\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: That's true, but today we're not here to talk business. Let's have a drink.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Absolutely. It really will help you take your mind off things."}, {"time": "", "image": "", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: So, how did you come across this place?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Actually, I used to do gigs here.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: You were a musician? I didn't know. You're such a dark horse.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I wasn't supposed to tell you. My career counsellor advised me not to. Of course, she thought that this information was going to jeopardize my chances of getting a better job.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: What's the matter with that? It's obvious that the music and the fashion industry are closely connected to each other.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I know. It was just a hobby but it was an arduous task. I was only supposed to play three times a week but ended up playing almost every night."}, {"time": "", "image": "", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: This is interesting. Thanks for sharing that with me.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: No problem. Of course I'm supposed to mind my own business, but what actually motivated you to sponsor five children?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I was just appalled by the situation in poor countries and wanted to help.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Wow. You're so compassionate. I'm glad we work together."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Isn't this a great place?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Yes, and it's classy. In fact, I've never heard of it before.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: It's not new. Actually, I come here all the time. I was going to bring you here but I never had a chance to.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: There were so many things we were supposed to do together. In fact, going for a drink was one of them.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I know, but you don't like to mix business with pleasure so ...\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: That's true, but today we're not here to talk business. Let's have a drink.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Absolutely. This will help you take your mind off things."}, {"time": "47000", "image": "", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: So, how did you come across this place?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Actually, I used to play gigs here.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: You were a musician? I didn't know that.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I wasn't supposed to tell you. My career counsellor advised me not to. Of course, she thought that this information was going to jeopardize my chances of getting a better job.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: What's the matter with that? Actually, the music and the fashion industry are closely connected to each other.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I know. It was just a hobby but it was an arduous task. I was only supposed to play three nights a week but ended up playing almost every night for no money."}, {"time": "90000", "image": "", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: This is interesting. Thanks for sharing that with me.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: No problem. I know I'm supposed to mind my own business, but what actually motivated you to sponsor five children?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I was just appalled by the situation in other countries and wanted to help. We're very lucky to the have the lifestyle we do, and I want others to have the same opportunities.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Wow. You're so compassionate. I'm glad we work together."}], "video_src": "engenn8le04ob11re2vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "video", "id": 2, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "A Serious Image Problem"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Unwinding "}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 4}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.3"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Explain customs and appropriate behaviour at work and in different countries, using a wider range of expressions and formulas. "}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn8le04ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Be Supposed To and Be Going To"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the structure <span class=\"strong\">be supposed to</span> and <span class=\"strong\">was/were going to</span> when you want to talk about expectations, obligations or arrangements."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">be supposed to</span> to talk about situations in the past, present or future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The structure is:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Subject + To be + supposed to + verb"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Present: He <span class=\"strong\">is supposed to look</span> into that today.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Past: <span class=\"strong\">He was supposed to look</span> into that yesterday.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Future: He <span class=\"strong\">is supposed to look</span> into that tomorrow.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br /><br />You use <span class=\"strong\">be going to</span> in the past to talk about something that was expected but did <ul>not</span> happen. The sentence sometimes includes a \"but\" phrase to explain what happened."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br />The structure is:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br />Subject + was/were going to + verb"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br />Example: <br /><span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">was going to bring</span> you here but had a chance to."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br />NOTE: When you say \"supposed to\", you link the /d/ and /t/ sounds together, Like this: be suppose_to"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I was going to bring you here but never had a chance to.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">There were so many things we were supposed to do together. </span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I wasn't supposed to tell you.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">She thought that this information was going to jeopardize my chances of getting a better job.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I was only supposed to play three times a week but ended up playing almost every night</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Of course I'm supposed to mind my own business.</span>"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Using Expressions like \u201cOf course\u201d and \u201cIn fact\u201d "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use expressions like of course, in fact, actually and really to emphasize that something is true."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Using <span class=\"italic\">\"of course\""}, {"type": "text", "content": "To say that you agree or disagree with someone.<br /><span class=\"italic\">Of course, but has he broken any international laws?</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "To say something that you believe someone probably already knows or will not be surprised about. <br /><span class=\"italic\">Of course, there are justifications."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br />Using <span class=\"italic\">\"in fact\"</span> and <span class=\"italic\">\"actually\"</span><br /><br />To add something to what you have just said, especially something that may seem surprising.<br /><span class=\"italic\">In fact, these children start at the age of seven."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br />You also use phrases like <span class=\"italic\">\u201creally\u201d</span>, <span class=\"italic\">\u201cnaturally\u201d</span> and <span class=\"italic\">\u201cit is obvious\u201d</span> to emphasize that something is true."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">In fact, I've never heard of it.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Actually, I come here quite often.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">In fact, going for a drink was one of them. </span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Actually, I used to do gigs here.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">It's obvious that the music and the fashion industry are closely connected to each other. </span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Of course I'm supposed to mind my own business, but what actually motivated you to sponsor five children?</span>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "classy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "stylish or fashionable"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Yes, and it's classy."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words to review."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to mix business with pleasure"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to mix work and fun"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You don't like to mix business with pleasure."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to take your mind off something"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to allow you to stop worrying about something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It will help you take your mind off things."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to jeopardize"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to put in danger"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This information was going to jeopardize my chances of getting a better job."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be closely connected"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be closely connected"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The music and the fashion industry are closely connected to each other. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "task"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "job"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It was just a hobby but it was an arduous task."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob11aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to mind your own business"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to not ask someone private questions "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I know I'm supposed to mind my own business."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob11aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to sponsor"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to \u200bsupport a \u200bperson, \u200borganization, or \u200bactivity by giving \u200bmoney, \u200bencouragement, or other \u200bhelp"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What actually motivated you to sponsor five children?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob11aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "appalled"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "shocked by something bad"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I was just appalled by the situation in poor countries and wanted to help."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob11aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "compassionate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "feeling sympathy for people and a need to help them"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You're so compassionate. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob11aud10"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think about some things that you expected to do in the past but that you didn't do. (You can make them up)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write at least 6 sentences expressing what you were going to do."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Include a \u201cbut\u201d phrase to express what happened or why you didn't do what you expected."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your sentences with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Help your partner correct any errors in his or her sentences."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about expectations in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write sentences about expectations in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share sentences with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I help my partner correct sentences."}]}]}